{
 "_about": "af-telemetry event taxonomy. Every event type, its consent level and the ONLY data fields it may carry. id = a short machine id (letters, digits, . _ - : /; never 8+ digits in a row); int = a count or duration; feedback_text = the person's own previewed and redacted words (fb.* only); diagnostics = allowlisted counts and versions (fb.problem only). Levels: install (needs the installation's consent, no person), person (needs installation AND person consent, carries a pseudonymous person reference), feedback (sent deliberately by the person, allowed without tracking consent). prio: 0 = kept longest, 5 = dropped first.",
 "version": 1,
 "contact": [
  "none",
  "whatsapp",
  "call",
  "in_app"
 ],
